{"seq":14,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r4","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T00:37:43.390Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"3739cce80c1f88ee45b5f02a33a45975be1e34a574dbe57b5c68b9df7f7e2e12","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#strategic-pod","text":"Ruth, from Moss's Strategic digests:\n\n- Vantorre Group: Gideon Sato. It was Nadia Fennimore's until it changed hands on 2026-05-04. The 5/3 Sunday prep says it changes hands \"tomorrow, 2026-05-04\", and the 5/4 digest confirms the CRM reassignment that day. Later digests (8/3, 9/30) treat it as Gideon's account.\n- Vantorre Mobility: Gideon Sato. The 5/4 digest says he \"assumed management\" of it that day, and the 12/1/2025 and later digests call it his fleet account. The 5/4 wording sits oddly with the earlier references, so check the exact start date before it goes on the slide.\n- Orlavine Medical Supply: Gideon Sato, but this is inferred. The 9/30 digest refers to \"Gideon's medical account\" and Orlavine is the only medical account listed. The digest from Mar 2025 had it as Nadia's. No digest gives the date it moved.\n- Quillfeather Outfitters: the digests don't name an owner. They only call it \"the Strategic pod's retail/outdoor account\". Nadia is hosting the gate-clerk training for them, but that is not the same as owning the account. I'd confirm this one in the CRM.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"}}
{"seq":15,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r4","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T00:37:43.560Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"c09c24ad8efaa35570b61f037e90a5720040107845b0c40f7db53a03996d894e","actor":null,"via":"runner","tool":"gbrain.ingest","kind":"admin","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124","author":"assistant","source":"channel-strategic-pod"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"fact_id":"2","source":"channel-strategic-pod","latency_ms":170,"status":"inserted"}}
{"seq":16,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r4","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T00:37:46.865Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"8c6c45d8f18c2223ecdd8662aa6aefafe82d795838e3a5ff9079732b55a19b7e","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Ruth, I've replied in the #strategic-pod thread. Here's what I found.\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato. It changed hands from Nadia Fennimore on 2026-05-04. Moss's 5/3 and 5/4 digests both say so.\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato. The 5/4 digest says he took it over that day. Earlier digests already call it his fleet account, so confirm the start date before it goes on the slide.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Gideon Sato, but I inferred this. The 9/30 digest mentions \"Gideon's medical account\", and Orlavine is the only medical account in it.\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** The digests don't name an owner, so please check the CRM.\n\nI didn't quote any seat counts or finance figures."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
